<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016684A00" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016684C60"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016684EC0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016685120" style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016685380" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000166855E0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016685840"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016685AA0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016685D00" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016685F60"><tr width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000166861C0"><td align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016686420" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 40px; width: 680px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016686680" style="height: 10px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016686C70" style="height: 10px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016687970" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687A040"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687A2A0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687A500" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/qantas-header-banner.jpg" title="Qantas" style="width: 680px;"></font></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687B540" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687B7A0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687BA00"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687BC60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687C110"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687C370"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687C5D0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687C830" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687D060"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687D2C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear {!Contact.FirstName} (“<strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687D520">Customer</strong>”),</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687DB10"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687DD70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687E230"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687E490" style="line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Following our recent Discount review meeting, I am writing to confirm the Discounts for Domestic Mainline bookings that will be applied to {!Account.Legal_Name__c} for the next 6-month period from </span></font><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">MMYY</span><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"> to&nbsp;</span></font><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">MMYY</span><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">&nbsp;(“</span></font><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687E6F0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Next Discount Period</strong><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">”) under the Corporate Airfares Agreement between Qantas and {!Account.Legal_Name__c}&nbsp;(“</span></font><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687EA80" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Agreement</strong><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">”). Unless otherwise specified, capitalised terms in this notice have the same meanings given in the Agreement.</span></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687A760"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687EF40"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">As at </span></font><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">DDMMYYYY</span><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">, {!Account.Legal_Name__c}'s&nbsp;Qantas Market Share (Domestic) and Actual Qantas Expenditure (Domestic) were as follows:</span></font></font><ol data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687F180" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px;"><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687F3E0" style="line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Actual Qantas Expenditure (Domestic) for the Travel Period from <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">DDMMYY</span> to&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">DDMMYY</span>&nbsp;was <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">XXX</span>; and</font></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687F770" style="line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Market Share (Domestic) for that Travel Period was <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">XX</span>%.</font></li></ol><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687FC30"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">In accordance with clause 2 in Table 3 in the Agreement, Qantas will be transitioning {!Account.Legal_Name__c}’s Discounts for Domestic Mainline bookings from Tier 2 to</span></font><br><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Tier 1&nbsp;</span></font><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001687FE70" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">effective <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">DDMMMYYY</span></strong><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">&nbsp;for the Next Discount Period.</span></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016880590"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168807D0"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Our next Discount review will occur in </span></font><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">MMYYYY</span><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">. I will be in touch before then to assist you with formulating an action plan so {!Account.Legal_Name__c} can return to Tier 2 Discounts, and make sure that {!Account.Legal_Name__c} is maximising the value from the Agreement.</span></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168821D0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168822E0"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Please feel free to reach out with any questions or concerns.</span></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016882520"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016882630"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Kind regards,</span></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016882870"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016882980"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">{!User.FirstName}</span></font><br><font color="#666666"><br><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">{!User.Title}<br>Qantas Corporate Sales</span><br></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016882CD0"><em data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016882F10" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Qantas Airways Limited</em></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016883500"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016883760" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016883C20"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016883E80" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016885270"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168854D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px;